WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:04.362
After a long sleep, Rat awoke.

2
00:00:04.363 --> 00:00:06.845
He sat up in his chair.

3
00:00:06.846 --> 00:00:09.838
"You look much better," said Mole.

4
00:00:09.839 --> 00:00:14.016
Rat's eyes were clear again.

5
00:00:14.017 --> 00:00:17.415
"What happened to you?" asked Mole.

6
00:00:17.416 --> 00:00:20.392
"You almost left the riverbank!"

7
00:00:20.393 --> 00:00:23.226
"I don't know," said Rat.

8
00:00:23.227 --> 00:00:25.750
"It's hard to say."

9
00:00:25.751 --> 00:00:29.737
Rat told Mole about the visitor.

10
00:00:29.738 --> 00:00:33.418
"I listened to Sea Rat," said Rat.

11
00:00:33.419 --> 00:00:36.544
"His story was like a dream.

12
00:00:36.545 --> 00:00:40.493
I acted as if I wasn't awake."

13
00:00:40.494 --> 00:00:44.663
"How very strange," said Mole.

14
00:00:44.664 --> 00:00:48.948
"Now, I feel sad," said Rat.

15
00:00:48.949 --> 00:00:53.105
"Rat, you'll be happy again," said Mole.

16
00:00:53.106 --> 00:00:55.154
"Just look outside."

17
00:00:55.155 --> 00:00:57.751
"Why?" asked Rat.

18
00:00:57.752 --> 00:01:01.992
"The apples are red," said Mole.

19
00:01:01.993 --> 00:01:05.218
"Nuts are falling from the trees.

20
00:01:05.219 --> 00:01:07.429
The pumpkins are fat!"

21
00:01:07.430 --> 00:01:11.916
"I'm feeling a little better," said Rat.

22
00:01:11.917 --> 00:01:14.852
Mole went to get Rat's notebook.

23
00:01:14.853 --> 00:01:17.293
He found a pencil too.

24
00:01:17.294 --> 00:01:19.643
"Here, Rat," said Mole.

25
00:01:19.644 --> 00:01:23.488
"You haven't written in a long time."

26
00:01:23.489 --> 00:01:26.759
"I don't want to," said Rat.

27
00:01:26.760 --> 00:01:30.195
He pushed the notebook and pencil away.

28
00:01:30.196 --> 00:01:33.657
"I'll let you rest some more," said Mole.

29
00:01:33.658 --> 00:01:38.127
Mole set the notebook on the table.

30
00:01:38.128 --> 00:01:42.608
After Mole left, Rat picked up the pencil.

31
00:01:42.609 --> 00:01:45.545
He sat with the notebook on his knee.

32
00:01:45.546 --> 00:01:49.910
Then Rat started a new poem.

33
00:01:49.911 --> 00:01:56.502
"Home Sweet Home," he wrote.

